---
import GlowIcon from "./GlowIcon.astro";
import DisplayHeading from "./DisplayHeading.astro";
---

<section class="theme section-shell section-shell--wide" id="theme-builders" data-section="theme" data-node-id="358:808">
  <div data-reveal="icon"><GlowIcon variant="theme" nodeId="358:809" /></div>
  <div class="theme__body">
    <div class="section-copy">
      <div class="display-heading-mask" data-reveal="heading">
        <DisplayHeading text="THEME BUILDERS" mobileLines={["THEME", "BUILDERS"]} tone="orange" nodeId="358:824" />
      </div>
      <p class="section-headline localized-copy theme__headline" data-reveal="copy">
        <span data-locale="ru">Создал конструктор тем и дизайн-систему <br />для white-label продукта</span>
        <span data-locale="en" hidden>Built a theme constructor and design system <br />for a white-label product</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="theme__visual-stage" data-card-reveal>
      <img class="theme__visual" src="/assets/theme-builders.png" alt="" width="1376" height="768" />
      <article class="theme-metric theme-metric--speed theme-metric--desktop interactive-card">
        <strong class="joyride-metric">×2</strong>
        <p><span data-locale="ru">скорость разработки темы</span><span data-locale="en" hidden>faster theme production</span></p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="theme-copy" data-detail-card data-card-reveal>
      <p class="theme-copy__secondary">
        <span data-locale="ru">Конструктор тем — это дизайн-система, которая состоит из 432 переменных, 500 экранов, 100 стилей.</span>
        <span data-locale="en" hidden>The theme builder is a design system made of 432 variables, 500 screens and 100 styles.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="theme-copy__primary">
        <span data-locale="ru">Конструктор создан вокруг необходимости быстро делать брендированные сайты обмена валют с типичным сценариями — выбор валют, создание заявки на обмен, верификация, оплата заявки, профиль.</span>
        <span data-locale="en" hidden>The builder was designed to rapidly create branded currency-exchange sites with recurring flows: currency selection, exchange request, verification, payment and profile.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="theme-copy__details" id="theme-details">
        <span data-locale="ru">Конструктор позволяет брендировать сценарии обмена, добавляя в них <br />уникальные иллюстрации, иконки, шрифты, цвета, стили и эффекты.</span>
        <span data-locale="en" hidden>The builder brands exchange journeys with unique illustrations, icons, fonts, colours, styles and effects.</span>
      </p>
      <button class="more-button" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="theme-details" data-details-toggle>
        <span data-locale="ru">Подробнее</span><span data-locale="en" hidden>Details</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="theme-metrics" data-card-reveal>
    <article class="theme-metric theme-metric--speed theme-metric--mobile interactive-card">
      <strong class="joyride-metric">×2</strong>
      <p><span data-locale="ru">скорость разработки темы</span><span data-locale="en" hidden>faster theme production</span></p>
    </article>
    <article class="theme-metric theme-metric--primary interactive-card">
      <strong class="joyride-metric">250</strong>
      <p><span data-locale="ru">дизайнов на конструкторе<br />уже сделано без моего участия</span><span data-locale="en" hidden>designs already made with the builder without my involvement</span></p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
